Sean, very on brand of you to mention Australia though, because not only are they one of the

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:02.580
beaches you can play as in Kings of the Beach.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:05.500
Didn't mention. You can't, you can't play as the beach.

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:07.240
I should have, I should have said that correctly.

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:11.540
What I meant to say was that's one of the locations you can go to in Kings of the Beach

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:20.160
is Australia. But also we have listeners in Australia based on information that I get from Anchor, our like

