00:11:30.840 --> 00:11:32.220
Yeah. I was surprised too.

00:11:32.280 --> 00:11:38.380
It kind of feels, um, I mean, it's so simple, like really when you break it down, but it feels good.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:45.660
