00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.020
And, and I didn't really get that.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:54.960
I thought that, uh, it felt really good to, I mean, what do you, you do three things you set, you, you spike and you serve really like that.

00:11:54.960 --> 00:11:59.040
That's really it. Um, you could also block too.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:06.580
